      "width": 346.5,
      "height": 210.0,
      "text": "1   int size\n        ↓  AtomicInteger\n\n2   table[i] = node          (empty bucket)\n        ↓  table.compareAndSet(i, null, node)\n        no lock at all\n\n3   walk + mutate chain      (non-empty)\n        ↓  synchronized (head) { ... }\n        one lock per bucket\n\n    get()  →  UNCHANGED, lock-free",
      "originalText": "1   int size\n        ↓  AtomicInteger\n\n2   table[i] = node          (empty bucket)\n        ↓  table.compareAndSet(i, null, node)\n        no lock at all\n\n3   walk + mutate chain      (non-empty)\n        ↓  synchronized (head) { ... }\n        one lock per bucket\n\n    get()  →  UNCHANGED, lock-free",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
